Error [jet.ConcurrentCaptureNotOwned]: `particles` cannot be moved while `left` is lent to a task in `g`
  --> tests/ui/taskgroup_lent_owner_moved.jet:16:16
    |
 16 |         n: eat(particles)
    |                ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: A task.group joins its children at the end of the block, so `left` stays borrowed until `g` joins — changing `particles` now would race a running task or free memory it still reads
 Fix: Do this after the `g` block ends, give it away with `task &&left`, freeze it with `freeze`, or share it with `shared`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1101
